  "id": "suicide-prevention-center",
  "term": "suicide-prevention center",
  "definition": "A suicide-prevention center is a service that supports people at risk of suicide, including crisis counseling and follow-up contact after emergency department or inpatient discharge. It may work in partnership with hospitals to reach patients after they leave acute care.",
